<title>UK: Salomon sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc has issued 20,000 European-style capped low exercise price option (LEPO) warrants on registered shares of Novartis, lead manager Salomon Brothers Finanz AG said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by one warrant.</p>
<p> LONG CALL STRIKE   0.01 CHF	     ISSUE PRICE  2,039 CHF</p>
<p> SHORT CALL STRIKE  2,250 CHF	    SPOT REF     2,283.5 CHF</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE	24.JUN.98	    PAYDATE	30.JUN.97</p>
<p> NOTES	PAYOUT IS CASH IF CLOSING PRICE OF UNDERLYING AT</p>
<p>		EXPIRY IS EQUAL TO OR ABOVE CAP-LEVEL, PHYSICAL IF</p>
<p>		BELOW CAP-LEVEL.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
